body:
I am having a hierarchical object in json. I am using **connectMenu** to list out the catogories in a dropdown. When I give **attributeName: "taxonomies\_hierarchical.category.lvl0"** i got response. But When I give **attributeName: "taxonomies\_hierarchical.category.lvl1"**, the result is empty. How can I get the **lvl1** values?

```
"taxonomies_hierarchical": {
        "category": {
          "lvl0": [
            "Manchester"
          ],
          "lvl1": [
            "Manchester > Hopwood House"
          ]
        }
}
```
